hs; K material-editor vertical splitter + tabbed n,k/Gyration/mu multi-curve charts, dirty-confirm on Cancel and OnClosing; L pure strict-v1 intensity/ellipsometric parsers, <STORE:ExperimentDataProxy> with thin file adapter in Storage (the only new real IO), inverse state + collection builder + last-folder (lastFolders re-typed to purpose-keyed map), <UICOMP:SolverHandoffWindow> validation screen (no solving); M <STORE:TestDbContext> EFC proof project (SQLite-tested, unreferenced by the app) + <STORE:SeedingProxy> seeding project over empty-store constructors; N single recent-files store (Storage.RecentFiles kept, env field dropped), one UiIds module, launcher Main/Inverse/Materials/Library, warning sweep, final WIRE_UI. 11 contract placeholders emitted for minting. Every cited pointer was Read-verified against the current tree (drifts fixed vs the preliminary: validateSample at ElementId.fs:626, remove-block at :755-765, toMuWithDisp at Berreman/Dispersion.fs:671). Deterministic checks run locally: 47 steps, zero non-placeholder failures; all 11 placeholders carry valid prefix/kind/language/declaring-project. Recorded interpretation calls in .spec-md: seeded samples stay UserManaged (only presets ProtectedBuiltIn); launcher carries Main-only between steps 4 and 45; scene vs experiment-collection persistence as two separate proxies; live Experiments.ExperimentCollection keeps its name (only the Groups one renames); handoff screen named SolverHandoffWindow."}
